<%= render 'followup_title', order: @order %>
<%# A show the house produced gets the house's own letter. A show it merely
    presented leads with the visiting company's message, then the survey, then
    the house's note -- see the editorial rules in sites/README.md.

    The opening line was plural where the rest of the letter (and its signature)
    is not; TheaterInfo#first_person? now decides it, as it decides every other
    pronoun here. %>
<% if @order.performance.production.theater.producing? %>
<p>
  <%= theater_info.first_person? ? 'I hope' : 'We hope' %> you had a good time here at the theater and will return soon (there are a few suggestions in
  the sidebar on the right, but check our website for all upcoming events).
</p>
<%= render 'core_followup', order: @order %>
<% else %>
<%= render 'followup_custom_message', order: @order, neutral_fallback: true %>
<%= render 'survey_prompt', order: @order %>
<%= render 'host_callout', order: @order %>
<% end %>
